  "derivation_rationale": {
    "source_spine": "Public PVEL/Kiwa hail stress sequence breakage anchors, with IEC baseline as near-zero certification anchor.",
    "form_reasoning": "Logistic form is a bounded monotone threshold-like model appropriate to sparse breakage probability anchors.",
    "demoted_sources": "Field performance and stow guidance inform mechanism/adjustment direction but do not supply universal numeric DR parameters.",
    "tier_mix": "Core unstowed archetype curves are mostly T2/T3; stow adjustment and the Hazard-compatible support-cost allocation profile are T4. Curve-intrinsic spread is not carried, but a downstream consumer may compute a frequency-driven annual loss distribution from sampled events."
  },
